Still missing periods because our splitter is splitting lines at **closing quote or parenthesis** followed by CJK even when it's not a new sentence. Wait validation lines like `“夀”是“寿”` no period means original line maybe `“夀”是“寿”的异体字。` got split at closing quote before `的`? Our connector list doesn't include `的`, so it split after `"寿"` before `的`, resulting two pieces:
